@startuml design_ddd_context_map
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    BorderColor #2B2D42
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontColor #2B2D42
    FontStyle bold
    FontSize 13
}

skinparam card {
    BackgroundColor #EDF2F4
    BorderColor #8D99AE
    BorderThickness 1
    FontColor #2B2D42
    FontSize 11
}

title <size:15><b>MicroShield - Domain-Driven Design (DDD) Context Map</b></size>\n

package "Edge Detection Bounded Context\n(Bare-Metal C99 / Hard Real-Time)" as EdgeContext {
    card "<b>Aggregate Root:</b>\n• DetectionEngine" as AR_Edge
    card "<b>Value Objects (Immutable):</b>\n• RawFrame (Payload + Meta)\n• FeatureVector (4x float32)\n• ClassificationVerdict (Ternary)\n• RuleDescriptor (Leaf ID + Split)" as VO_Edge
    card "<b>Domain Events:</b>\n• FrameIntercepted\n• FrameQuarantined\n• TelemetryEmitted" as EV_Edge
}

package "Supervisory MLOps Bounded Context\n(Workstation Python 3.11+ / Asynchronous)" as MLOpsContext {
    card "<b>Aggregate Root:</b>\n• FleetDriftTracker" as AR_MLOps
    card "<b>Entities:</b>\n• AnomalyRecord (UUID, NodeID, Time)" as ENT_MLOps
    card "<b>Domain Services:</b>\n• ASTTranspilerService\n• DriftEvaluationService" as SRV_MLOps
    card "<b>Domain Events:</b>\n• ConceptDriftDetected (> 5%)\n• ModelRetrained\n• TranspilationCompleted" as EV_MLOps
}

package "Compliance & Audit Bounded Context\n(Regulatory / CRA & NIS 2 Governance)" as AuditContext {
    card "<b>Aggregate Root:</b>\n• IncidentAuditLog" as AR_Audit
    card "<b>Entities:</b>\n• SecurityIncident (Forensic Log)" as ENT_Audit
    card "<b>Repository Interface:</b>\n• IForensicEvidenceRepository" as REP_Audit
    card "<b>Domain Events:</b>\n• IncidentReportGenerated\n• RegulatoryAuditExported" as EV_Audit
}

' Relazioni formali DDD (Upstream / Downstream, Published Language, Customer/Supplier)
EdgeContext -right-> MLOpsContext : <b>[U/D]</b> Upstream -> Downstream\n<b>[PL]</b> Published Language: COBS+CRC32 Telemetry\n<b>[C/S]</b> Edge supplies Anomaly Stream

MLOpsContext -down-> AuditContext : <b>[U/D]</b> Feeds Validated Alerts\n<b>[C/S]</b> Audit consumes Drift & Anomaly Logs

EdgeContext -down-> AuditContext : <b>[PL]</b> Direct Raw Event Integrity\n(Non-tamperable Hardware Timestamps)

@enduml
